# deploy.map — your personal files to replicate across machines.
#
# This is DATA, not code. To replicate a file on every machine:
#   1. commit the file somewhere in your mesh-identity repo,
#   2. add ONE line below,
#   3. run `mesh install`.
# No script editing, no AI needed. (Scaffolded from mesh-workstation/template/.)
#
# ── Line format ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   src | dst | mode | perms
#
#   src    Path RELATIVE to your identity repo — the file you committed.
#   dst    Absolute destination. `~`, `$HOME` and `$USER` are expanded.
#   mode   How to write dst (default: overwrite):
#            overwrite      replace dst every install; backs up a changed file
#                           first; refuses to clobber an unmanaged rc file.
#            once           write only if dst does NOT exist — a seed you own.
#            managed_block  merge ONLY between the mesh markers; preserve the rest.
#   perms  Octal mode, default 0644. 0600 for secrets-adjacent, 0755 for bin.
#
# Only `src | dst` is required; leave a field empty to take its default (keep the
# pipe so later fields line up):
#   shell/zshrc.local | ~/.zshrc.local                     → overwrite, 0644
#   ssh/config        | ~/.ssh/config        | | 0600      → overwrite, 0600
#   ssh/authorized_keys | ~/.ssh/authorized_keys | managed_block | 0600
#
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored.
#
# Real secret-bearing config (api tokens, auth.json, npmrc) does NOT go here —
# it goes through the encrypted secrets layer:
#   `mesh secret add`  to capture, `mesh secret deploy` to place.
#
# The entries below are a STARTER set matching the files template/ scaffolds.
# Delete the ones you don't use; add your own.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

ssh/authorized_keys | ~/.ssh/authorized_keys | managed_block | 0600

git/gitconfig.local | ~/.gitconfig.local     | once
git/gitignore_global | ~/.config/git/ignore

shell/bashrc.local  | ~/.bashrc.local        | once
shell/zshrc.local   | ~/.zshrc.local         | once
shell/aliases.sh    | ~/.zshrc.d/99-personal-aliases.sh
shell/aliases.sh    | ~/.bashrc.d/99-personal-aliases.sh
